    "description": "Large modular UPS catalog for building-level / MDF deployments at or above 15 kVA. Models prioritize: (1) modular hot-swap power and battery modules so capacity can grow incrementally and any single module failure is non-disruptive, (2) lithium-ion batteries for ~10-year life and reduced footprint vs VRLA. Includes single-phase rack-tower hybrids and three-phase floor-standing systems. Three-phase entries assume 208V or 480V input — the recommendation engine includes both, the user picks the voltage class that matches their service.",
